; Length tables and the two frequency tables ($4F37-$50FA), identical in all banks.
; FreqTable_SGB is used for music when wSystemFlags bit 7 (SGB) is set; its periods
; are ~2.4 % lower to cancel the SGB's faster clock.
; Generated by tools/mmgen.py from the ROM; edit freely, build_check.sh verifies.


